# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Canon C-Log2
# Cameras  : C70, C300 III, C500 II, EOS R5 C, EOS C70
# Input    : Canon C-Log2 log / Cinema Gamut
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  Cinema Gamut → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.700 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.534 – 0.544
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.463 – 0.473
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.393 – 0.403
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.327 – 0.336
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.265 – 0.273
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.100
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Canon C-Log2"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

